WEBVTT

00:08:28.712 --> 00:08:33.008
are in fact capturing more
carbon dioxide than they emit.

00:08:33.551 --> 00:08:36.762
This is kind of along the lines
of the quality assurance,

00:08:36.762 --> 00:08:40.432
quality control and process
trials we rely on

00:08:40.474 --> 00:08:42.810
to ensure that our vaccines are safe

00:08:42.851 --> 00:08:44.353
and that they work.

00:08:45.354 --> 00:08:48.023
But most importantly,

00:08:48.065 --> 00:08:51.527
we need more practice
doing the actual thing

00:08:51.569 --> 00:08:54.530
rather than trying
to get it perfect on paper.

00:08:55.322 --> 00:08:58.367
If we don't try, we can't learn,

00:08:58.367 --> 00:09:02.121
and if we don't learn,
we cannot iterate and improve.